{"unit_id":"artuasova__dsh-balance-ru#card-zh","repo":"artuasova/dsh-balance-ru","commit":"9176a441ac97e5d776ab44d6db20af292562c038","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-ru 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的余额与用量插件，在侧栏操作区提供余额面板，并在聊天轮次末尾显示本轮估算。它通过 Harness 服务查询账户及已配置服务商余额，同时汇总本机按模型、会话和轮次记录的 Token 用量与费用。面板展示明确的缺少凭据、权限、限流和未定价状态，也可编辑模型价格并重算历史估值。美元和人民币金额旁可显示依据日汇率近似换算的卢布值，并内置俄语界面。适合希望在 Harness 中查看余额和本地使用成本的用户；需要 Harness 0.2.2-rc.1，卢布换算需联网获取汇率。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:363-476","index.js:69-106","usage.js:48-76","client.js:172-189"]}
{"unit_id":"artuasova__dsh-balance-ru#card-en","repo":"artuasova/dsh-balance-ru","commit":"9176a441ac97e5d776ab44d6db20af292562c038","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-balance-ru adds provider balances and local daily usage estimates to the Harness Web sidebar. It groups costs by model, session, and turn, supports custom model prices, and shows approximate ruble conversions for USD and CNY. Requires Harness 0.2.2-rc.1; exchange rates need internet access.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:363-476","index.js:69-106","usage.js:48-76","client.js:172-189"]}
