{"unit_id":"artuasova__dsh-balance-ru#feature-1","repo":"artuasova/dsh-balance-ru","commit":"9176a441ac97e5d776ab44d6db20af292562c038","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-ru 的功能「服务商余额」：在侧栏面板查看 DeepSeek 账户和已配置服务商的余额及状态。打开面板或点击刷新后查询，并显示余额类别、币种和更新时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:75-106","balances.js:38-60","client.js:437-448"]}
{"unit_id":"artuasova__dsh-balance-ru#feature-2","repo":"artuasova/dsh-balance-ru","commit":"9176a441ac97e5d776ab44d6db20af292562c038","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-ru 的功能「今日用量估算」：根据本机记录的模型 Token 用量和可用单价计算费用，并在面板显示今日汇总。用户可按模型或会话展开查看明细；未记录或未定价的调用会单独标示。","source":"generated","evidence":["usage.js:48-76","usage.js:97-126","client.js:455-461"]}
{"unit_id":"artuasova__dsh-balance-ru#feature-3","repo":"artuasova/dsh-balance-ru","commit":"9176a441ac97e5d776ab44d6db20af292562c038","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-ru 的功能「自定义模型单价」：在价格页面为提供商和模型设置输入、输出及可选缓存单价，支持 CNY 或 USD。保存后会更新用量投影并重算历史估算。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:54-61","pricing.js:2-16"]}
{"unit_id":"artuasova__dsh-balance-ru#feature-4","repo":"artuasova/dsh-balance-ru","commit":"9176a441ac97e5d776ab44d6db20af292562c038","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-ru 的功能「卢布近似换算」：在余额和费用金额旁附加以日汇率估算的卢布显示。客户端读取汇率并缓存六小时；原金额和币种仍保留，网络不可用时不显示换算值。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:166-189","client.js:191-210"]}
{"unit_id":"artuasova__dsh-balance-ru#feature-5","repo":"artuasova/dsh-balance-ru","commit":"9176a441ac97e5d776ab44d6db20af292562c038","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-ru 的功能「俄语界面与轮次用量」：内置俄语词条并注册俄语语言选项，同时在聊天轮次末尾展示该轮用量和费用估算。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:469-476","client.js:430-436"]}
{"unit_id":"artuasova__dsh-balance-ru#caveat-1","repo":"artuasova/dsh-balance-ru","commit":"9176a441ac97e5d776ab44d6db20af292562c038","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-ru 使用前须知：卢布换算需要浏览器请求日汇率源并缓存六小时；离线时不显示卢布值（见 client.js:172-210）。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:172-210"]}
